  "analysis_plan": "Primary (two robots, 20 seeds, 18 conditions, seed averages over equally weighted conditions): S_opt = J(r2opt) - J(optimizer), selection value of optimization at matched volume, 95% t interval. Secondary: V_opt = J(matched_random, results/controls) - J(r2opt), the effect of reducing random admission from rollout to optimizer coverage, and the exact identity J(staff_rollout) - J(optimizer) = V_opt + S_opt - S_roll with S_roll = J(matched_random) - J(staff_rollout). Coverage match is reported as the ratio of random to target coverage per condition. Fleets four and eight (6 seeds, 8 conditions): the same decomposition with fleetXroll replacing matched_random, exploratory. Subgroups by arrangement are exploratory.",
